# .gitignore for the PRIVATE BACKUP REPOSITORY (not this source repo).
#
# During Pi setup, copy this file into the cloned backup repo as its `.gitignore`
# (see README "Backup & Recovery"). It ignores everything except the two backup
# artifacts and the repo's own README/.gitignore, so a stray file — e.g. an
# accidentally-placed `.env` — can never be committed and leak a secret (FR-007).
*
!budget.db
!budget-export.json
!README.md
!.gitignore
